# The guard: a room with cover walls, and one agent that patrols a round of four waypoints. A behavior tree decides what
# it does (ai/guard.decision), and its perception fills the tree's keys from what it sees (ai/guard.perception). The
# intruder is a Perceivable with the Player tag that walks to and fro through the west cover wall. When the guard sees
# it, the guard chases it. When the wall hides it, the guard goes to where it saw it last, and then goes on with its
# round. Select the guard in the editor while the game plays to see which nodes run (see
# docs/editor/decision-editor.md#live-view). Positions are raw World_Position values in units of 2^-24 m, so
# 2516582400000000000 is 1.5e11 m. The editor writes this file; see docs/editor/document-and-scenes.md#scenes.
